IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `pfa-fund`

-- Pension Fund Act 1995, ss 4, 6-10, 12(2), 13 and the Schedule -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_pension-fund-act-1995.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

`a civil service pension under the Pensions Act` MEANS Payment WITH
    `is a pension, gratuity or allowance on death, superannuation, resignation, retirement or discharge` IS TRUE
    `is a disability pension, injury allowance, gratuity or compensation for injury` IS FALSE
    `the injury was received in and is attributable to the service` IS FALSE
    `is granted under a law in the Schedule` IS TRUE
    `the person has been in the public service in Singapore` IS TRUE
    `is paid under a prescribed superannuation scheme` IS FALSE
    `is a gratuity on death or retirement of local staff of a Singapore diplomatic mission` IS FALSE
    `is another expense of granting an (a) or (b) benefit` IS FALSE
    `written law expressly provides it is met out of the Fund` IS FALSE
    `is an expense of administering, investing or managing the Fund` IS FALSE
    `is authorised by the Minister` IS TRUE

