§ `s 4(2) -- net income from investments`

#ASSERT `net income from investments` 1000 200 0 EQUALS 1200
#ASSERT `net income from investments` 1000 0 300 EQUALS 700
#ASSERT `net income from investments` 100 0 250 EQUALS -150

